{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on the House-Destroyer (Kuṭidūsakavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:0.4", "PA_ja_327:1.1"], "en": "7. The Kākavatī Jātaka “And from there this fragrance wafts forth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:1.2"], "en": "where my beloved dwells.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:1.3"], "en": "\"For far from here is Kākavatī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:1.4"], "en": "where my mind finds delight.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:2.1"], "en": "\"How did you cross the ocean?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:2.2"], "en": "How did he cross the Kepuka river?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:2.3"], "en": "How did he cross the seven seas?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:2.4"], "en": "And how did he climb the Simbali tree?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:3.1"], "en": "“By you I crossed the ocean,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:3.2"], "en": "by you I crossed the Kepuka;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:3.3"], "en": "by you I crossed seven oceans.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:3.4"], "en": "“By means of it, I climbed the *simbali* tree.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:4.1"], "en": "“Shame on this massive body!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:4.2"], "en": "Shame on this insentient thing!”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:4.3", "PA_ja_327:4.4"], "en": "“Wherever I bring and carry away my wife’s paramour.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_327:5.1"], "en": "The Kākavatī Jātaka, the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
